  "description": "Eternity is a high school girl who loves her school and her friends, so much so that she's been nicknamed the \"school bully\". The new year starts off with a bang... but the atmosphere of the class is ruined on the first day by Yeon-woo, who gives off a bad vibe.\n\nAfter being misunderstood as an acquaintance because she knows his name, Yeong-won is forced to sit next to him, and her friends are furious with her attitude. When they ask if they really know each other, she tells them it's a secret.\n\nWhat is the connection between these two seemingly mismatched people, and what is the secret hidden in Yeong-won's house...?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/neverend_house)",
